    "text": "4 hours ago ABERDEEN, S.D. – Northern State started its NSIC portion of the season with a 65-48 loss to the University of Jamestown. In the game, the Wolves tallied 48 points, 37 rebounds, 10 assists, eight steals and three blocks, and committed 20 turnovers. As a team, Northern shot 34% from the field, 11.8% from deep and 58.8% at the line. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
